{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も一日お疲れちま(*´ω｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"風邪ひきさんを心配してくださり、ありがとうございます＊\nご心配おかけしました(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"体調は戻りました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は明日の京都全国握手会のため、日奈は学校が終わってからすぐに新幹線に飛び乗りました(´・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから制服のままのすっぴんちゃん(。・_・。)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2013/04/19/6999543/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっでも着替えは、キャリーケースをお母さんに持ってきてもらい、学校の荷物と交換してもらったから、ちゃんとあります♪笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして...\n新幹線はみくもとお隣＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2人でお勉強してます(；・ω・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美雲は英語...\n日奈も英語の宿題..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少しでも空いてる時間で頑張らなきゃ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2013/04/19/6999543/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑新幹線に乗ってる臨場感が感じられるくらいのブレ♪笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日の京都全国握手会は、日奈の憧れであるまいやんお姉たま(＃^.^＃)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きな大好きなまいやんお姉たま♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お姉たまファンの皆様...\n明日はどうか、よろしくお願いいたします(。・ω・。)ゞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなちまふぁみりーのみなさん...\nひなちまってますね(*´ー｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん気をつけてお越しください*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"残念ながらお留守番のふぁむさん、\nひなちまふぁむの皆さんとお姉たまふぁむの皆さんから元気沢山もらってレポしますので、待っててね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【4月17日 やくさん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆HAPPY BIRTHDAY☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"充実した素敵な一年となりますように...*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2013/04/19/6999543/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日も一日幸せでありますように＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい...*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好き"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日奈"}],"source":"archive"}